> Check the fitted field at the original diagnostic time

The source evaluates the field at t=.5 on all 128 **raw held-out inputs**, not
on a quarter-trajectory state. Grey velocity segments below end at x+5f(x,.5)
for visibility; both original and endpoint markers are retained. The trace panel
contains exact trace, both probe contractions, their paired mean and the trace
of actual field Jacobians for every row. Paired and actual traces here use
Double reductions of the saved Float32 fields, as in the source diagnostic;
the model's mode-3 arithmetic computes its pair in the working tensor dtype.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/cnf_field.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){
