> Retain every observation and the fixed-final comparison

All 768 original observations appear below. Validation NLL decreases from
2.902513027 to 2.895504951 over the three fixed epochs. Held-out test NLL is
2.994471788: only .000160035 below full Gaussian, and .000660428 above diagonal
Gaussian. Both baselines use fitting-only MLE moments; analytic truth is a
reference density, not a selected fit. These fixed-run differences do not
quantify a repeatable improvement or between-run uncertainty.

